        "eng": "Miss Bernard said.",
        "jpn": "バーナード嬢曰く。"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "The story centers around a lazy girl's love for famous literary works along with her bookworm friends. Sawako \"Miss Bernard\" Machida wants to be well-versed in literature but she doesn't actually read those books! Encounter various prominent works including the Bible, The Tale of the Heike, The Great Passage, Fermat's Last Theorem and more that she hasn't read.",
        "jpn": "バーナード嬢こと町田さわ子と、\r\n読書家の友人たちが図書室で繰り広げる\r\nブンガクな日々。\r\n\r\n古今東西あらゆる本への愛と、\r\n「読書家あるある」に満ちた\r\n“名著礼賛\"ギャグ！"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Bernard-jō Iwaku.",
        "Bernard-jou Iwaku."
    ],
